WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.798
Hi, I'm Rosie, your guide to Navigate

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:03.541
The Pathway.

00:00:04.041 --> 00:00:06.178
You already have experiences that matter.

00:00:06.678 --> 00:00:08.605
This is a private practice space where

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.869
you can track courses and experiences,

00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:14.190
reflect on compassion and your values, learn

00:00:14.236 --> 00:00:15.142
with your cohort,

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:17.419
and shape the story you may use

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:19.265
in your medical school application.

00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:22.898
Each station explains why the work matters,

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:25.023
guides one manageable action,

00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:28.286
and saves something useful on this device.

00:00:28.786 --> 00:00:31.433
There are no points, rankings, or perfect

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:31.874
routes.

00:00:32.374 --> 00:00:34.092
You choose where to begin, and you

00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:36.403
can change direction whenever you need to.

